---
import Module11Behold from './Module11Behold';
import Module11Derive from './Module11Derive';
import Module11Operate from './Module11Operate';
import Module11Prompts from './Module11Prompts';
---

<div class="m m11">
  <section class="m-block m11-block">
    <p class="m-eyebrow">behold</p>
    <p>
      Treat the chorale as a physical system. The Krumhansl-style
      inference from Module 9 is the system's <em>order parameter</em>:
      a vector in tonic-space pointing to the inferred key, with a
      magnitude (the correlation) measuring how committed the system
      is. Add thermal noise, and watch the order parameter shrink —
      until at high enough temperature the magnetic domain breaks
      down and no key wins decisively.
    </p>
    <Module11Behold client:visible />
  </section>

  <section class="m-block m11-block">
    <p class="m-eyebrow">derive</p>
    <p>
      Six dictionary entries between condensed-matter physics and
      tonal music. The mapping isn't strict isomorphism — but every
      term on the right behaves like the one on the left in the
      ways that count.
    </p>
    <Module11Derive client:visible />
  </section>

  <section class="m-block m11-block">
    <p class="m-eyebrow">operate</p>
    <p>
      A temperature dial. Pull it toward zero (quench) and the
      chorale's tonal field locks into C major decisively. Push it up
      and the inferred-key margin collapses; second-place keys start
      trading the lead with each re-noise. Music is active matter
      doing the same kind of work other ordered phases do: balancing
      symmetry against the driving forces that break it.
    </p>
    <Module11Operate client:visible />
  </section>

  <section class="m-block m11-block">
    <p class="m-eyebrow">prompt</p>
    <p class="m-prompt-intro">
      Two cards on the physics mapping.
    </p>
    <Module11Prompts client:visible />
  </section>

  <section class="m-block m11-block m-bridge m11-bridge">
    <p class="m-eyebrow">bridge</p>
    <p>
      Twelve modules. Z<sub>12</sub> to active matter. The math was
      the ladder; the music was the ceiling — and they share more
      structure than music theory has usually been willing to admit.
      The spine ends here. The cards live on at{' '}
      <a href="/practice">/practice</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</div>

<style is:global>
  /* Module 11 specific rules. */

  .m11-behold,
  .m11-derive,
  .m11-operate {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.95rem;
    margin: 1rem 0;
    padding: 1.25rem 1rem;
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 4px;
  }

  /* Readout bars (Behold) ---------------------------------------------- */
  .m11-readout {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 360px;
  }
  .m11-readout-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 4rem 1fr 3.5rem;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }
  .m11-readout-label {
    font-family: var(--font-jetbrains);
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .m11-readout-bar {
    height: 0.55rem;
    background: var(--bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 2px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .m11-readout-fill {
    height: 100%;
    transition: width 0.25s ease;
  }
  .m11-thermo {
    background: linear-gradient(
      to right,
      rgba(76, 134, 200, 1),
      rgba(232, 168, 56, 1),
      rgba(186, 70, 70, 1)
    );
  }
  .m11-order {
    background: var(--accent);
  }
  .m11-readout-value {
    font-family: var(--font-jetbrains);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--text);
    text-align: right;
  }
  .m11-key-card {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 0.55rem;
    padding: 0.55rem 0.95rem;
    background: rgba(232, 168, 56, 0.08);
    border: 1px solid var(--accent);
    border-radius: 3px;
  }
  .m11-key-card-label {
    font-family: var(--font-jetbrains);
    font-size: 0.58rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .m11-key-card-name {
    font-family: var(--font-crimson);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .m11-key-card-margin {
    font-family: var(--font-jetbrains);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  /* Derive table ------------------------------------------------------- */
  .m11-mapping-table {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 540px;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    font-family: var(--font-jetbrains);
  }
  .m11-mapping-table th {
    text-align: left;
    font-size: 0.6rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    padding: 0.45rem 0.6rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .m11-mapping-table td {
    padding: 0.55rem 0.6rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    vertical-align: top;
  }
  .m11-mapping-table tr:last-child td {
    border-bottom: none;
  }
  .m11-mapping-table td:first-child {
    color: var(--accent);
    width: 14rem;
  }

  /* Operate ------------------------------------------------------------ */
  .m11-slider-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 6.5rem 1fr 3rem;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 420px;
  }
  .m11-slider-label {
    font-family: var(--font-jetbrains);
    font-size: 0.6rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .m11-slider {
    -webkit-appearance: none;
    appearance: none;
    width: 100%;
    height: 3px;
    background: var(--border);
    border-radius: 2px;
    outline: none;
  }
  .m11-slider::-webkit-slider-thumb {
    -webkit-appearance: none;
    appearance: none;
    width: 18px;
    height: 18px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--accent);
    cursor: pointer;
    border: 2px solid var(--bg);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px var(--accent);
  }
  .m11-slider::-moz-range-thumb {
    width: 18px;
    height: 18px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--accent);
    cursor: pointer;
    border: 2px solid var(--bg);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px var(--accent);
  }
  .m11-slider-value {
    font-family: var(--font-jetbrains);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    text-align: right;
  }
  .m11-hist {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 360px;
  }
  .m11-inference {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.3rem;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 360px;
  }
  .m11-inf-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.5rem 1fr auto;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0.4rem 0.7rem;
    background: var(--bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 3px;
    font-family: var(--font-jetbrains);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .m11-inf-row.dim {
    opacity: 0.7;
  }
  .m11-inf-pos {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
  }
  .m11-inf-key {
    font-family: var(--font-crimson);
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--text);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }
  .m11-inf-top {
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .m11-inf-corr {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
  }
  .m11-margin {
    font-family: var(--font-jetbrains);
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    text-align: right;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-top: 0.1rem;
  }
  .m11-operate-controls {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.45rem;
  }
  .m11-operate-btn {
    font-family: var(--font-jetbrains);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 3px;
    padding: 0.4rem 0.85rem;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition:
      color 0.15s ease,
      border-color 0.15s ease;
  }
  .m11-operate-btn:hover {
    color: var(--accent);
    border-color: var(--accent-dim);
  }

  .m11-behold-caption,
  .m11-derive-caption,
  .m11-operate-caption {
    font-size: 0.92rem !important;
    color: var(--text-dim) !important;
    text-align: center;
    margin: 0 !important;
    line-height: 1.55 !important;
    max-width: 48ch;
  }
  .m11-behold-caption em,
  .m11-derive-caption em {
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .m11-operate-caption strong {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 500;
  }
</style>
